        "description": "__Height:__ 157 cm (5' 2\")  \n__Relatives:__ Yuki Fuyuumi (Younger Brother), Daigoro Fuyuumi (Father)\n\nShe is an uptight and by the book member of the Student Council's Hallway Monitoring Committee, it is hinted that she often reprimands [Chiwa](https://anilist.co/character/48999/Harusaki-Chiwa) due to her rowdy behavior along the hallways. Ai is talented at cooking. She and [Eita](https://anilist.co/character/48997/Kidou-Eita)'s friend, [Kaoru](https://anilist.co/character/75772/Asoi-Kaoru), were classmates in elementary school.\n\n~!Ai is Eita's fiancée. She is also actually his childhood friend, whom he met 1 year before Chiwa.!~",
